  "id": "autoradiography",
  "term": "autoradiography",
  "definition": "Autoradiography is an imaging method that estimates how a substance is distributed in a sample by detecting and quantifying tracks recorded in a detector. In this source, neutron autoradiography is used to assess boron microdistribution, and its accuracy depends on careful image acquisition and analysis.",
